-- synopsis
A soothing yet engaging selection of Future Lounge music.
-- synopsis

-- more

Too tired or busy to even decide what you’d like to listen to? Try this blend of smooth aural blancmange with an occasional crystal of fondant.

This album introduces the *Future Lounge* genre: relaxing background music, fully machine-rendered, (mostly) untouched by human hands except for fine-tuning of lyrics, track selection and mastering. The tracks you hear have passed through a stringent process of iterative generation, refinement, selection, and compilation.

May contain traces of irony or beauty.

---

## Credits

All tracks and artwork were created by St33v using AI tools including ChatGPT and Suno. Some lyrics were hand-crafted (just like the old days) while others were combined human/machine efforts. The tracks that comprise this album were selected from hundreds of variations and mastered using Audacity for your listening pleasure.

Concepts and lyrics by St33v™

Post-production by St33v™
-- more


